{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11115220","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11115220","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1111522001:0":{"text":"结束了……？","source_cn":"结束了……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E6F795EB2F850AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1111522002:0":{"text":"我还活着……真不敢相信。","source_cn":"我还活着……真不敢相信。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1467C1643563BEF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111522003:0":{"text":"安丹，看到了吗？你不在的这段时间，我也成长为可靠的战斗力了呢。","source_cn":"安丹，看到了吗？你不在的这段时间，我也成长为可靠的战斗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5698976C81CFC6DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111522004:0":{"text":"萨忒娜姐姐！呜呜呜……萨忒娜姐姐！","source_cn":"萨忒娜姐姐！呜呜呜……萨忒娜姐姐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BE4870CDBD7255E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111522005:0":{"text":"哎哎哎？你这小孩，不要突然扑过来啊！","source_cn":"哎哎哎？你这小孩，不要突然扑过来啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99A805E134F843FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111522006:0":{"text":"要不是你在战斗中干扰敌人！我肯定再也见不到安丹姐姐了！","source_cn":"要不是你在战斗中干扰敌人！我肯定再也见不到安丹姐姐了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36513226450EE65F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111522007:0":{"text":"我以为你会抢走安丹姐，所以一直对你很凶，你却依然愿意救我！你真好……","source_cn":"我以为你会抢走安丹姐，所以一直对你很凶，你却依然愿意救...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB82DCA2F6290F929","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111522008:0":{"text":"从现在起，你和安丹姐姐都是我最喜欢的人了！","source_cn":"从现在起，你和安丹姐姐都是我最喜欢的人了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6425C06F794E6B0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111522009:0":{"text":"哼，留着你的好意吧， 最喜欢的人只能有一个，你可不要太贪心。","source_cn":"哼，留着你的好意吧， 最喜欢的人只能有一个，你可不要太贪心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2712D801225B47C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111522010:0":{"text":"谁又是萨忒娜心中最喜欢的人呢？","source_cn":"谁又是萨忒娜心中最喜欢的人呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EB0FD09535FD0D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111522011:0":{"text":"你慢慢想吧，以你的死脑筋，我看你多久才能想出来！","source_cn":"你慢慢想吧，以你的死脑筋，我看你多久才能想出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E7DF5F6D77094B4"